{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地把反复追问后的疲惫、没有中断的牵挂、重新被唤起的柔软向往与逐渐聚起的前进力量联系起来，也解释了为什么无法挽回的部分仍使每次发力都受到阻碍；但它对226–241小节内部从试探到末尾聚拢的具体转折，以及身体如何在反复承压后改变应对方式、使停滞松动的机制，主要停留在概括层面。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把起初收住自己、反复发力却未能卸压、身体逐渐无力维持自我检查、末尾推进暂时压过犹疑，以及由此产生的局部解脱连成了较完整的因果链；其中关于是否得到回应、所珍惜之物是否值得争取等心理内容，比听感记录所能直接确认的范围更具体，但它们总体仍服务于音乐中压力累积与前进意志形成的解释。\",\n    \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n    \"why\": \"乙不仅保留了甲关于柔软的向往能够推动前进、不可挽回的现实又使发力持续受阻的核心解释，还进一步说明了压力如何累积、身体如何先于明确的自我判断改变行动，以及行动方式的变化为何带来暂时解脱，因此对这一段从试探到聚拢、从紧张到停滞松动的具体因果转折解释得更清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1061cc19-abc2-4363-b482-841843df2de2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135836013028Z", "elapsed_seconds": 60.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:59:36.809591+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "14434441d91f63de5047f8e4ba5952bd2b829f41d0c659dc8629864d625e7f8e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3